                    Tarot Interviews is opening a small number of free community partner spots for tarot, folklore, heritage, arts and culture&hellip;
                ]]>
            </summary>
        <content type="html">
            <![CDATA[
                    <p><img src="https://finbarre.com/media/posts/17/PXL_20260607_144122581-1.jpg" class="type:primaryImage" alt="A close-up photograph of Rider-Waite-Smith style tarot cards spread across a patterned surface. The Three of Pentacles card is centred, showing three figures beneath a gothic arch, surrounded by other visible cards including the Six of Wands, Ace of Pentacles, Queen of Wands and Page of Pentacles. The image is used to promote free community partner audio spots for Tarot Interviews, open to tarot, folklore, heritage, arts and culture organisations." /></p>
                <p class="wp-block-paragraph">Tarot Interviews is opening a small number of free community partner spots for tarot, folklore, heritage, arts and culture organizations.</p>
<p class="wp-block-paragraph">Selected partners can share a finished 30 second audio message with Tarot Interviews listeners. <strong>There is no fee</strong>. In return, I ask partners to help spread the word with an Instagram follow, social post, tag or link where possible.</p>
<p class="wp-block-paragraph">UK-based projects, podcasts and cultural or heritage work may be prioritised, but international submissions are very welcome.</p>
<p class="wp-block-paragraph">Please send finished audio only, as a WAV or high quality MP3.</p>
<p class="wp-block-paragraph">Spots are limited and all submissions will be reviewed before approval.</p>
<p class="wp-block-paragraph"><a href="https://docs.google.com/forms/d/1Y4rtCPAuG6KRVYgUf0xvYJ9J7lF7l9G0AAioaPEqFt4/edit">Apply Here</a></p>
            ]]>
        </content>
